  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "教學研究與評量",
    "sub_ename": "STUDIES OF TEACHING AND ASSESSMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在探討課堂管理和教學與學習評量的實際應用。本課將介紹如何的營造並建立舒適安全的課室環境，進而幫助學習者自我的了解與成長、有效的教育實踐、和學習評量，建立一個正向課堂學習的環境。本課程也將討論關於課堂中學習目標、課室規則和階段性的開發策略，以激勵學生對行為的自主權和責任感，處理擾亂課室的行為以及評估教學與適切評量學習結果的方法。透過個案研究、課堂中的討論和參與，學生將透過自身的經驗與獲得之知識，發展出一套課室管理哲學，並發展出一套個人管理模式並自訂出適切的學習評量方法。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to explore a practical application of classroom management and teaching-and-learning assessment. The course will present a framework for creating a safe and positive classroom environment built on an understanding of self, learner’s development, sound educational practice, and learning assessment. This course will discuss strategies for developing classroom goals, rules, and procedures for encouraging student ownership and responsibility for behavior, dealing with disruptive behaviors as well as appropriate ways to evaluate teaching-and-learning outcome. Through case studies, discussions in the class, and participate in lectures, students will reflect and develop a classroom management philosophy, and will begin to develop a personal classroom management model and tailor appropriate ways of assessment.",
